        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Except as provided in Sections 6.a.1, 6.a.2 and 6.b, below, employees in limited appointments may have their appointment terminated or have their time reduced at the sole discretion of the University and without recourse to the grievance and arbitration procedures of this Agreement.",
